| 13 | `chunks` `[0..32768]` | `requireArray(object,"chunks",maxBlobChunks)` → `maxBlobChunks+1` |

`TestBlobDescriptorMediaTypeBoundaryReachesBothIdentityEntries` covers the
255-character bound but not the lowercase rule.

### §10.4 Transfer Manifest

| # | Widened gate | Mutant that survives |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 14 | `entries` `[0..65536]` | `requireArray(object,"entries",65_536)` → `65_537` |
| 15 | `ManifestEntry.mode` `uint32[0..4095]` | `requireUint(entry,"mode",4095)` → `4096` |
| 16 | symlink target rejects `\` / Windows separators | `strings.Contains(target,`\`) \|\| …` → `false \|\| …` |
| 17 | `child_manifest_ids` `[0..1024]` | `1_024` → `1_025` |
| 18 | `excluded_classes` `[0..128]` | `128` → `129` |
| 19 | `remotes` `[1..16]` | `requireArray(parent,"remotes",16)` → `17` |
| 20 | `WorkspaceSnapshot.members` `[1..256]` | `requireArray(object,"members",256)` → `257` |
| 21 | `required_filter_names` `[0..64]` | `64` → `65` |
| 22 | `agent_project_config_paths` `[0..256]` | `requireSortedUniquePaths(…,256)` → `257` |
